156
00:15:50,250 --> 00:15:52,275
<font color="#ffff00">Jack, desculpe.</font>

157
00:15:52,300 --> 00:15:54,300
<font color="#ffff00">Vem cá, me desculpe.</font>

158
00:15:57,150 --> 00:15:58,650
<font color="#ffff00">Desculpe.</font>

159
00:15:59,350 --> 00:16:01,425
<font color="#ffff00">Tem razão, não foi legal.</font>

160
00:16:24,325 --> 00:16:26,925
<font color="#ffff00">Para onde vamos
