161
00:16:27,625 --> 00:16:31,075
<font color="#ffff00">- Bem aqui, no Quarto.
- Mas e os sonhos?</font>

162
00:16:31,700 --> 00:16:34,725
<font color="#ffff00">Entramos na TV pra sonhar?</font>

163
00:16:37,650 --> 00:16:39,650
<font color="#ffff00">Nunca saímos daqui.</font>

164
00:17:33,550 --> 00:17:34,650
<font color="#ffff00">Posso abrir?</font>

165
00:18:08,850 --> 00:18:10,975
<font color="#ffff00">Por que os alienígenas
